            "title": "1682 photos",
            "heading_level": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "div",
            "add_description": true,
            "description": "The 1682 Conference explored the rapidly evolving landscape of innovation. This year's event dove deeper into how AI is transforming business processes and boosting profitability. Attendees will gained exclusive insights from industry leaders who have navigated the complexities of implementing cutting-edge, results-driven strategies. Hosted in partnership with Five Below, the 2024 1682 Conference was held at their corporate headquarters in downtown Philadelphia. Like O3, Five Below is deeply rooted in Philly’s innovative spirit, making this collaboration a perfect reflection of the 1682 brand, which honors Philadelphia's founding in 1682."
          }
